SUMMARY:Free Event- Love in the Modern World: The Challenges of Dating and
  Relationships
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 (Free Online Event)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\\*We prefer t
 hat you turn your camera's on\n\n**Free Event- Love in the Modern World: T
 he Challenges of Dating and Relationships**\n\nLove\, dating and relations
 hips have always had their challenges\, but has something fundamentally ch
 anged in the modern world? Dating apps\, social media\, changing expectati
 ons\, greater independence\, financial pressures and seemingly endless cho
 ices have transformed the way we meet\, connect and build relationships. J
 oin us for an open and respectful Zoom discussion as we explore what moder
 n love looks like today—and whether finding a meaningful\, lasting conne
 ction has become more difficult.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nArrival Time:\nPlease join us bet
 ween 8:00 pm and 8:10 pm (if you can)\nThe conversation begins right away 
 :)\n\nWe’ll discuss questions and topics including:\n\n* How have expect
 ations of men and women changed?\n* Are independence and long-term relatio
 nships sometimes in conflict?\n* What role do social media and technology 
 play in modern relationships?\n* Why can people feel lonely even when they
  are in a relationship?\n* Are our expectations of romantic partners becom
 ing unrealistic?\n* Has traditional romance disappeared—or simply change
 d?\n* What does a healthy\, loving relationship look like today?\n\nCome w
 ith your experiences\, observations\, questions and ideas. You don't need 
 to be single or currently dating—this discussion is open to anyone inter
 ested in exploring love\, relationships and human connection in the modern
  world.\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Social Club**\n\nmeetup.
 com/soulcity/\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveFlemmingSongs/videos\n\n\\*If
  you do wish to support and contribute to this and these Thursday Night on
 line events that include 3 plus hours of music after\; you can do so throu
 gh e transfer or pay pal to steveflemming11@gmail.com\nYou're support and 
 gratitude is greatly appreciated!\n\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.
 us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\n\n**Bonus:**\n**Stick around after the event for Steve Flemming 
 Presents: Songs with Heart**\nCanadian Folk\, Country Artist and Adult Con
 temporary
