SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart and Soul 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for an inspiring and enjoyable experience with **Songs with
  Heart and Soul!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\, nature\
 , the future\, the past\, the present\, spirituality and the search for me
 aning in life :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps:/
 /youtu.be/vei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoug
 htful songwriting\n* Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n* Li
 fe reflection and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help you understand your
 self better\n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are so
 ngs about ordinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, an
 d the search for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time s
 tarting at 9:15 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n
 \nSteve Flemming\n(Canadian Folk\, Country and Adult Contemporary)\nhttps:
 //www.youtube.com/@SteveFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming 
 Presents: Songs with Heart and Soul**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming's s
 ongs explore the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, imag
 ination\, and heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, rock\, 
 blue eyed soul\, and singer-songwriter traditions\, his work touches on th
 emes of love\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\, per
 sonal growth\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning. His songs often 
 feature memorable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical questions\
 , and a deep curiosity about life and human nature.\n\n**Songs containing:
 **\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine craftsmanship
 \n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming is a prolific folk-country 
 songwriter\; whose songs explore ordinary people\, gratitude\, personal re
 flection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning.\nHis songs 
 explore freedom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisdom
  hidden in ordinary life.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**P
 ay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pa
 y pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute i
 s greatly appreciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings am
 ong music lovers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j
 /495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-
